D8.3A - placeholder tracked so this directory exists on a fresh clone.
Dockerfile does `COPY sources/ /build/vendored-sources/` -- if the two
pinned tarballs (ffmpeg-*.tar.gz, dav1d-*.tar.gz, see ../sources.lock.json)
are present here at build time, build.sh uses them directly (no network
needed); otherwise it falls back to downloading from the pinned URLs and
verifies the SHA-256 either way. The tarballs themselves are gitignored
(*.tar.gz) -- never committed.
